# =============================================================================
# CRITICAL — Atlas evaluation integrity boundary
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# data/ground_truth.json is the sealed answer key. The agent must NEVER see it.
# Only the eval harness (eval/) may read it. Keeping it out of git ensures it
# cannot be accidentally surfaced through repo search, IDE indexing, or a stray
# import. Do not remove this line. See docs/atlas-prd.md §7 and CLAUDE.md.
# =============================================================================
